    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Give me a daily scrum status using unordered list items in html format based on the following things I covered today.\n\n\"\"\"\n{{ $('Fetch User Story Data Node 2').item.json.description }}\n\"\"\"\n\nMake sure to only use the following allowed html tags (examples below) to make it look good:\n\"\n1. <strong>text</strong> (for bold)\n2. <em>text</em> (for italic)\n3. <h3>Text</h3> (<h1> <h2> or <h3> for headings)\n4. <strike>text</strike> (for strikethrough\ttext)\n5. <ol><li>text</li><li>text</li></ol> (for ordered list)\n6. <ul><li>text</li><li>text</li></ul> (for unordered list)\t\n7. <pre>text</pre> (for preformatted text)\n\"\n\nThe status should only reflect:\n1. The things I covered\n2. The thinkgs I will cover\n3. Blockers\n4. A funny note to reflect the status\n\nOnly give the result without any extra comments.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -416,
